  "text": " It's for a hand, said Kiva. That's what's written on it, in two books, under two names. For a hand. Not for a bank, a floor, a crossing or a sail. She made herself go on. It's Seven's word. It's my captain's name and mine. If it were wanted, I'd have to go to my four and to the order, and say it was wanted, and ask.",
